            "content": "<ul><li>Sleeps cool: breathable latex, wool, and cotton let heat escape all night </li><li>No chemical smell: organic materials with zero off-gassing </li><li>Firm, supportive feel that keeps your spine aligned </li><li>Built to hold its shape for years, backed by a 30-year warranty </li><li>Clean to the core: GOLS-certified, no foams, no fiberglass, no toxins</li></ul>",
